{"step_index":188,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T18:42:08Z","thinking":"**Constructing Sidebar Navigation**\n\nI'm now diving into building the `Sidebar` navigation. It looks like it will have seven items. Two are straightforward links: \"For you\" to `/for-you` and \"Library\" to `/library`. The \"Highlights\" item is more complex; it doesn't navigate. \"Search\" will need special handling as well. This may call for triggering something.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"\\\"use client\\\";\\n\\nimport React from \\\"react\\\";\\nimport Link from \\\"next/link\\\";\\nimport Image from \\\"next/image\\\";\\nimport { usePathname } from \\\"next/navigation\\\";\\nimport { useAppDispatch, useAppSelector } from \\\"@/redux/store\\\";\\nimport { openAuthModal, logoutUser } from \\\"@/redux/authSlice\\\";\\nimport {\\n  AiOutlineHome,\\n  AiOutlineBook,\\n  AiOutlineHighlight,\\n  AiOutlineSearch,\\n  AiOutlineSetting,\\n  AiOutlineQuestionCircle,\\n  AiOutlineLogin,\\n  AiOutlineLogout,\\n} from \\\"react-icons/ai\\\";\\n\\nexport default function Sidebar() {\\n  const pathname = usePathname();\\n  const dispatch = useAppDispatch();\\n  const { user } = useAppSelector((state) => state.auth);\\n\\n  const menuItems = [\\n    { name: \\\"For you\\\", path: \\\"/for-you\\\", icon: AiOutlineHome, disabled: false },\\n    { name: \\\"Library\\\", path: \\\"/library\\\", icon: AiOutlineBook, disabled: false },\\n    { name: \\\"Highlights\\\", path: \\\"#\\\", icon: AiOutlineHighlight, disabled: true },\\n    { name: \\\"Search\\\", path: \\\"#\\\", icon: AiOutlineSearch, disabled: true },\\n    { name: \\\"Settings\\\", path: \\\"/settings\\\", icon: AiOutlineSetting, disabled: false },\\n    { name: \\\"Help & Support\\\", path: \\\"#\\\", icon: AiOutlineQuestionCircle, disabled: true },\\n  ];\\n\\n  const handleAuthAction = () => {\\n    if (user) {\\n      dispatch(logoutUser());\\n    } else {\\n      dispatch(openAuthModal());\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <aside className=\\\"w-[200px] md:w-[280px] bg-[#f7faf9] border-r border-gray-200 min-h-screen flex flex-col p-4 md:p-6 shrink-0 sticky top-0 h-screen select-none z-40\\\">\\n      {/* Logo */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-10 px-2\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"relative w-10 h-10 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <Image\\n            src=\\\"/logo.png\\\"\\n            alt=\\\"Summarist Logo\\\"\\n            fill\\n            className=\\\"object-contain\\\"\\n            priority\\n          />\\n        </div>\\n        <span className=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-[#032b41] hidden md:inline\\\">\\n          Summarist\\n        </span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Na\n<truncated 2261 bytes>","Description":"\"Created scratch Sidebar.tsx in scratch directory.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ambat\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\c7e5dbbf-c810-4443-81c8-ce6c4ef145fb\\\\scratch\\\\Sidebar.tsx\"","toolAction":"\"Creating Sidebar file in scratch directory\"","toolSummary":"\"Write to file\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
