hed book cards list\\n- [x] Verification and Polish\\n  - [x] Verify production compilation (`npm run build`)\\n  - [x] Verify responsiveness on Mobile and Desktop\\n\"","Description":"\"Updated task.md to show all tasks are completed.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\ambat\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\c7e5dbbf-c810-4443-81c8-ce6c4ef145fb\\\\task.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating task list file\"","toolSummary":"\"Write to file\""}}]}
